\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {24}{\ignorespaces Beer-VSM operational closure (EXP-INTEGRATION-01, $46$ ticks, $2026$-$06$-$26$). Each of S1--S5 is causally active within its designated cybernetic scope under a single combined perturbation. The decisive observation is the tick-10 chain: S1 registered a dip, S2 delivered the caution signal, S3 \emph  {tried} to act, and S5 \emph  {stopped} it --- a complete vertical traversal of the model in one tick. The algedonic channel ($\bigcirc $) is correctly silent because the system never degraded; its firing behaviour is established in EXP-SEN-01.}}{44}{table.caption.73}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:closure}{{24}{44}{Beer-VSM operational closure (EXP-INTEGRATION-01, $46$ ticks, $2026$-$06$-$26$). Each of S1--S5 is causally active within its designated cybernetic scope under a single combined perturbation. The decisive observation is the tick-10 chain: S1 registered a dip, S2 delivered the caution signal, S3 \emph {tried} to act, and S5 \emph {stopped} it --- a complete vertical traversal of the model in one tick. The algedonic channel ($\bigcirc $) is correctly silent because the system never degraded; its firing behaviour is established in EXP-SEN-01}{table.caption.73}{}}
